Placeholder for platform modules:
  - configserver/  (Spring Cloud Config Server — externalized config)
  - eurekaserver/  (Netflix Eureka — service discovery)
  - gatewayserver/ (Spring Cloud Gateway — API gateway, Keycloak integration)

These will be added in iterations 3, 4, and 5 of the project plan. When the first
